e productivity, and save time by cutting down on admin. Head over to our\naccountancy management\npage to find our full range of software and services.\nHR Management\nWhen it comes to managing your people, IRIS\xa0offers a diverse range of\nHR management solutions\nto suit any business. Our software equips busy HR teams to easily manage every\xa0stage of the employee lifecycle. Find the best talent with specialist\nrecruitment software\nand\nrecruitment services\n, use integrated\nHR software\nto manage your people, and turn to our\nHR consulting and advice services\nwhen there’s a challenge to overcome. And if that’s not enough, our\nHR marketplace\nboasts a range of additional HCM solutions from a wide variety of trusted partners.\u200b Check out our\nHR management\npage to see our full range of software and services.\nEducation Management\nOur\neducation management solutions\nsupport schools and trusts with all areas of\nschool administration\n,\nworkforce management\n,\nfinance\n,\nand\ncompliance\n. IRIS Education software provides solutions for management information systems (\nMIS\n),\nparental engagement\n,\ncashless catering\n,\nHR\n,\npayroll\n,\nfinancial management\n,\nbudgeting\n, and\ndata\n.\nPayroll Management\nPay your people your way and choose from IRIS’ range of integrated\npayroll software\nand\npayroll services\n.\xa0Browse our professional range of\npayroll\xa0management solutions\nand learn how you can cut down on payroll admin, improve accuracy, and prevent payroll from running you! We also offer a range of\npayroll bureau software\nto help professional payroll providers throughout the UK.\nRead more\nSign up to our newsletter to receive news on IRIS, our big ideas and latest blog posts.\nFollow IRIS Software Group on Instagram\nIRIS Software Group Instagram Account\nFollow IRIS Software Group on LinkedIn\nIRIS Software Group LinkedIn Account\nFollow IRIS Software Group on X\nIRIS Software Group X Account\nFollow IRIS Software Group on Face